<https://w3id.org/deliberation/ontology#Facilitator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The role of hosting, guiding, or moderating a deliberation process. A facilitating entity (an individual, an organization acting as a participant, or an ArtificialAgent) is modeled as a Participant with hasRole pointing to a Facilitator role." .
