<https://w3id.org/deliberation/ontology#ArtificialAgent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A non-human participant in a deliberation process, such as an AI system, bot, or algorithm (e.g., a moderation system, a clustering model, or a language model producing summaries). Contributions and classifications produced automatically should be attributed to an ArtificialAgent so that machine-generated content remains distinguishable from human input." .
